flowchart TD
    A([Start checkHardResetPin]) --> B[Read RESET_PIN]

    B --> C{RESET_PIN == LOW<br/>AND resetTriggered == false?}

    C -- Yes --> D[Set resetTriggered = true]
    D --> E[Print WiFi RESET message]
    E --> F[Create WiFiManager instance]
    F --> G[Reset WiFi settings]
    G --> H[Clear OLED buffer]
    H --> I[Set OLED font]
    I --> J[Display 'WiFi RESET']
    J --> K[Display 'Rebooting...']
    K --> L[Send OLED buffer]
    L --> M[Delay 2000 ms]
    M --> N[ESP.restart]
    N --> O([End])

    C -- No --> P{RESET_PIN == HIGH?}

    P -- Yes --> Q[Set resetTriggered = false]
    Q --> O

    P -- No --> O
